        "provenance": {
          "source": "Nov 25 2026: the Elestio computers rebooted themselves every Sunday after unattended-upgrades (Automatic-Reboot true); team-lead switched that off in each computer's row and made the reboot our own drained, announced step. Node's own child_process and the system ssh, through tools/administer-a-rented-host; no package."
        }
